---
description: Dockerfile and Compose conventions
globs: **/Dockerfile*,**/*.dockerfile,**/compose*.y*ml,**/docker-compose*.y*ml
alwaysApply: false
---
- Pin base images by tag and digest; pin downloaded artifacts and verify checksums.
- Multi-stage builds; order layers from least to most frequently changing; use BuildKit cache mounts for package managers.
- Run as a non-root user with a numeric UID; no secrets in image layers or build args.
- Keep the image minimal: `--no-install-recommends`, no leftover caches or build tools in the final stage.
- Must work with both Docker and Podman; avoid Docker-only features unless necessary.
- Lint Dockerfiles with `hadolint`.
